// Schema check:     `ro-next --check-skills`
//
// Skill *visuals* live in `skill_effects.ron` (the unified effect pipeline).
// This file owns the behaviour flags that used to be skill-id branches in
// `ro-next/src/lib.rs` and the procedural layers/effects that the official
// effect tables cannot express (Storm Gust cloud, cast circle, warp portal,
// level aura).
//
// Loader: `ro-next/src/world/skills.rs`. The file is loaded through the
// normal client file loader (`data\client\skills.ron`), so a server can
// override it without rebuilding the client; the committed copy is also the
// compiled `include_str!` fallback.
